Subject: [PATCH v2 14/17] i2c: omap: simplify errata check
Date: Thu, 14 Jun 2012 19:24:24 +0300
Message-Id: <1339691067-919-15-git-send-email-balbi@ti.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.10.4
